= irritator news

== irritator v0.1.0 - 2020-xx-yy

* core: adds `single_server_queue`, a FIFO queue with one server (G/G/1,
  M/M/1/K) that follows the Lindley recurrence.
* core: a generator can multiply the values of its time source by its ta
  (`ta_source_scaled`), a factor then sets the rate of random arrivals.
* simulation_wrapper: the factors of the same link group take their values
  together, the groups stay combined in a cartesian product.
